1
00:00:00,904 --> 00:00:05,774
This video provides an overview of the MorphAgent front-end interface.

2
00:00:08,662 --> 00:00:13,640
Once the backend has started, the interface will open automatically.

3
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:20,205
From the Home page, you can start a new run or load results from a previous run for visualization.

4
00:00:24,848 --> 00:00:29,862
For this demonstration, I’ll start a new run and walk through the complete workflow.

5
00:00:31,298 --> 00:00:34,200
This will take us to the Configure page.

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,051
First, you need to select your dataset.

7
00:00:39,648 --> 00:00:46,837
Second, you need to enter the biological question you would like to ask.

8
00:00:47,865 --> 00:00:53,811
For this demonstration, I’ll use the bundled demo dataset and prompt.

9
00:00:55,759 --> 00:01:02,675
Third, you need to configure the model API connection by entering your API keys.

10
00:01:05,478 --> 00:01:11,720
This checkbox determines whether the LLM and VLM use the same model.

11
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:16,608
If you want them to use the same model, you simply select it.

12
00:01:18,433 --> 00:01:25,937
Fourth, you need to choose the analysis route and select the components you would like to include.

13
00:01:26,683 --> 00:01:30,800
The final two options support multiple selections.

14
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:35,803
In this demonstration, we’ll run both the Code and VLM routes.

15
00:01:40,052 --> 00:01:47,296
The Run page displays the complete workflow in real time and streams live logs from the backend.

16
00:01:48,486 --> 00:01:55,873
Here, you can monitor the current stage and check whether any errors have occurred.

17
00:01:59,486 --> 00:02:05,394
The full six-stage workflow usually takes about six to eight minutes.

18
00:02:06,270 --> 00:02:10,587
You can skip ahead to the completed run.

19
00:02:44,434 --> 00:02:51,465
The run is now complete. Select Review Features to inspect the results.

20
00:02:55,469 --> 00:03:01,645
This run generated ten features across the Code and VLM routes.

21
00:03:02,792 --> 00:03:14,625
When you select a feature, its description, category, and validation results are displayed in the panel on the right.

22
00:03:20,382 --> 00:03:23,057
The final step is to review the evidence.

23
00:03:24,242 --> 00:03:30,223
Select any generated feature from the list.

24
00:03:30,937 --> 00:03:39,316
A brief description of the selected feature appears below, while its supporting evidence is displayed on the right.

25
00:03:40,037 --> 00:03:53,795
The evidence includes CSV and JSON artifacts that document how each result was generated and extracted.

26
00:03:59,673 --> 00:04:02,834
Moreover, the image is also available.

27
00:04:14,035 --> 00:04:21,882
You can click this button to open the corresponding file directly.

28
00:04:30,183 --> 00:04:36,618
That’s all for the end-to-end MorphAgent workflow. Thanks for watching.
